{"title":"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_22\">Problem 22</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 22\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is a real valued function of the real variable <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is not identically zero, \nand for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/6/5565affe16eea368f94479532ed92b4bd1922588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a+b)+f(a-b)=2f(a)+2f(b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"282\" height=\"18\" />, then for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/4/204a847c584215948a32c79ef811adc157c25a52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }f(0)=1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }f(-x)=-f(x)\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }f(-x)=f(x)\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D) }f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y) \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E) }\\text{there is a positive real number }T\\text{ such that }f(x+T)=f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"482\" height=\"58\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/f/4af030c5fbe713412d4f6407e41c9d626884ab1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/22606c0d4bc9b6b707c4ebf8d51fba00193a6c1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(0)=4f(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82d0e714dd3855ef2e740b789ae984e1d7cd5f39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/0/a30d75aa46d57dbaf95f26f328de5d1d5cf0504b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(0,x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db0bed0d15f632f317278f5e6ae80caa602bf6a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)+f(-x)=2f(-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"192\" height=\"20\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/c/27cc3f9708c22241434c0a06f97875607e69a476.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ f(x)=f(-x)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"156\" height=\"32\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>Note: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0dda5d9cc1f37a095f591d50370589b47e20111c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"19\" /> satisfies the original equation and may be used to show that the other answer choices are incorrect.\n</p><p>~~JustinLee2017, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME\" title=\"1977 AHSME\">1977 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1977 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1977\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AH